        "filing_date": "2026-03-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "AI to Create: We design product candidates using our generative AI models trained on both proprietary and public biological datasets.",
        "start_character": 7975,
        "end_character": 8108
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001672688-26-000068",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001672688-26-000068-4d62b9f55e0e1c81",
        "accession_number": "0001672688-26-000068",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Advancing a diverse portfolio of internally developed programs: We are advancing a portfolio of internally developed programs, each designed using our generative AI models, including our Origin-1 de novo AI models, and our AI-driven lead optimization models.",
        "start_character": 17142,
        "end_character": 17400
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001672688-26-000068",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001672688-26-000068-4d62b9f55e0e1c81",
        "accession_number": "0001672688-26-000068",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Government authorities in the United States, at the federal, state and local level, and in the European Union and other countries and jurisdictions, extensively regulate, among other things, the research, clinical development, testing, manufacturing, quality control approval, labeling, packaging, storage, record-keeping, promotion, advertising, distribution, post-approval monitoring and reporting, marketing and export and import of pharmaceutical products, including biological products such as those that we or our partners develop.",
        "start_character": 46788,
        "end_character": 47325
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001672688-26-000068",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001672688-26-000068-4d62b9f55e0e1c81",
        "accession_number": "0001672688-26-000068",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Outside the United States, pricing and reimbursement of prescription pharmaceuticals are subject to government control in many countries, and there can be no assurance that favorable coverage and reimbursement levels will be available for any product we may develop.",
        "start_character": 95223,
        "end_character": 95489
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001672688-26-000068",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001672688-26-000068-4d62b9f55e0e1c81",
        "accession_number": "0001672688-26-000068",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "With the data to learn, the AI to create, and the wet lab to validate, we believe our lab-in-a-loop powers our ability to go from AI designs to wet lab-validated product candidates in as little as six weeks.",
        "start_character": 6658,
        "end_character": 6865
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001672688-26-000068",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001672688-26-000068-4d62b9f55e0e1c81",
        "accession_number": "0001672688-26-000068",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "however, ongoing reforms and cost-containment measures could materially adversely affect the pricing, coverage, reimbursement, and commercial viability of any products we may develop.",
        "start_character": 102941,
        "end_character": 103124
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001672688-26-000068",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001672688-26-000068-4d62b9f55e0e1c81",
        "accession_number": "0001672688-26-000068",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "•Increase the potential probability of success: Our AI models have been designed to enable multi-parametric predictions and simultaneous optimization of attributes in parallel, which we believe may enable the design of product candidates with defined characteristics that may be relevant to clinical development and thus increase the potential for clinical success.",
        "start_character": 5207,
        "end_character": 5572
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001672688-26-000068",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001672688-26-000068-4d62b9f55e0e1c81",
        "accession_number": "0001672688-26-000068",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Advancing AI drug creation by leveraging our proprietary data: We use data generated through our programs and design campaigns to support the continued development of our AI models.",
        "start_character": 19304,
        "end_character": 19485
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001672688-26-000068",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001672688-26-000068-4d62b9f55e0e1c81",
        "accession_number": "0001672688-26-000068",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As of December 31, 2025, we are advancing five wholly-owned, internally developed programs as well as several undisclosed internal pipeline programs currently in early discovery phase.",
        "start_character": 21145,
        "end_character": 21329
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001672688-26-000068",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001672688-26-000068-4d62b9f55e0e1c81",
        "accession_number": "0001672688-26-000068",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As such, we will seek a partner for ABS-101 rather than advance it through later-stage development ourselves, including a partnership focused on exploring a potential first-in-class indication outside of IBD.",
        "start_character": 36354,
        "end_character": 36562
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001672688-26-000068",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001672688-26-000068-4d62b9f55e0e1c81",
        "accession_number": "0001672688-26-000068",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Despite a favorable early safety profile and not withstanding positive interim Phase 1 results as announced in November 2025, we made the strategic decision to prioritize ABS-201 in the development of AGA and endometriosis where there are significant unmet medical needs and greater potential return on investment.",
        "start_character": 36039,
        "end_character": 36353
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001672688-26-000068",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001672688-26-000068-4d62b9f55e0e1c81",
        "accession_number": "0001672688-26-000068",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For a discussion of the risks we face relating to competition, see “Risk Factors—Risks Related to Biologic Drug Development”.",
